feat(M0): chaperone enrichment + sensitive RBAC + preview exports + toast fix

Three parallel tracks landing in one milestone:

Track B+C - Chaperone enrichment + shadow-delete
- Thumbnails (32px list / 96px detail) with signed Storage URLs (1h TTL) and
  initials fallback
- Linked-students chips (truncated 3 + "+N more")
- New shadow-delete flow: lifecycleStatus + deletedAt/By/Reason +
  restoredAt/By, plus per-chaperone revisions subcollection (server-write only)
- New endpoints: chaperone-delete, chaperone-restore (logAudit)
- chaperone-roster download adds Lifecycle/Deleted At/Deleted Reason columns
- New chaperone-audit download (cross-chaperone revisions, range-based)
- Show-deleted toggle + Restore button + DELETED badge on detail page
- History tab on chaperone detail (reverse-chrono revisions list)

Track D - Sensitive User Access RBAC + admin password reset
- New sensitive_user_access permission group with 5 fine-grained actions
  (view_rbac, edit_rbac, reset_user_password, view_user_directory,
  manage_custom_claims). Owner=true, admin=false (must be granted explicitly).
- Sidebar/AdminLayout hide RBAC + Users links entirely unless granted
- /v2/admin/users page: lists Firebase Auth users (50/page) with 3-dot menu
  -> Reset password modal (live 6-rule strength meter + match check)
- /api/v2/admin/users/list + .../[uid]/reset-password endpoints
  (verifyReauth maxAgeSec=120, weak_password 400, cannot_self_reset 403,
  password never logged, revokeRefreshTokens + mustChangePassword flag)
- /v2/admin/rbac access-denied panel + "Granted by Owner only" notice
- All sensitive grants emit rbac.sensitive_grant audit (high severity)

Track E - Preview-only exports + Hub deep-link + toast CSS fix
- New PreviewModal component (KPIs + sample rows + truncation note +
  "Open in Downloads Hub" CTA, handles 401/403/reauth_required)
- /v2/analytics + /v2/reports: replaced inline Export buttons with Preview
  buttons + "Need the full report? Use the Downloads Hub" banner
- /v2/admin/downloads deep-link support: ?card=<id> scrolls + pulses target
- globals.css: scoped light-mode text overrides so bg-{color}-950 toasts
  keep their light text (fixes pickup-admin toast regression)
